Summons an icy wall of [3, 5, 5, 7, 7 (TL1-5)] length for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns. Ice walls are transparent, but block projectiles and enemies.

Ice walls also emit freezing cold, dealing [8.18, 11, 13, 15, 17 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage for each ice wall within radius [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5)] of an enemy, and with each wall giving a 25% chance to freeze an enemy. This cold cannot hurt the talent user or their allies.

Each point in cold drake talents also increases your cold resistance by 1%.
